  "E14": {
    "id": "E14",
    "title": "被截走的电",
    "placeId": "power",
    "unlockCondition": {},
    "repeatPolicy": "once",
    "startNodeId": "intro_01",
    "description": "占据厂区的武装小队截走了居民区的供电。值班电工请你守住检修入口，让他拆掉那条私接线路。",
    "demoNote": "",
    "rewardIds": [],
    "nodes": {
      "intro_01": {
        "id": "intro_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "检修门外，一名穿厚绝缘服的男人横起断路杆。他身后的临时电缆通向被武装小队占据的仓库。",
        "next": "intro_02",
        "type": "stage",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_02": {
        "id": "intro_02",
        "speakerId": "plant_electrician",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "就是这根线。他们接上以后，居民支线一直断着。",
        "next": "intro_03",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_03": {
        "id": "intro_03",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "你能恢复吗？",
        "next": "intro_04",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_04": {
        "id": "intro_04",
        "speakerId": "plant_electrician",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "能。这一段已经隔离了，但得先让我进去操作。",
        "next": "intro_05",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_05": {
        "id": "intro_05",
        "speakerId": "powerline_repairman",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "仓库还在用电。谁也不许动这条线。",
        "next": "intro_06",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_06": {
        "id": "intro_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "你知道外面停的是哪一片？",
        "next": "intro_07",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_07": {
        "id": "intro_07",
        "speakerId": "powerline_repairman",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "知道。雇我的人要保仓库，我收了钱，就得守住这里。",
        "next": "intro_08",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_08": {
        "id": "intro_08",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "我也是收钱办事。现在有人请我把入口让出来。",
        "next": "intro_09",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_09": {
        "id": "intro_09",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "抢修工压紧面罩，双手举起长杆。值班电工退到隔离栏后。",
        "next": "intro_10",
        "type": "stage",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "intro_10": {
        "id": "intro_10",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "你待在那里。杆子放下之前，别过来。",
        "next": "fight_01",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "choice": {
        "id": "choice",
        "type": "stage",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "为了让值班电工能够进入检修位置，{主角姓名}走向守在门前的输电抢修工。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "fight_01": {
        "id": "fight_01",
        "type": "stage",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "为了让值班电工能够进入检修位置，{主角姓名}走向守在门前的输电抢修工。",
        "next": "battle",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "leave_01": {
        "id": "leave_01",
        "type": "stage",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "{主角姓名}与值班电工退到安全位置。",
        "next": "@map",
        "portraits": {
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "battle": {
        "id": "battle",
        "type": "battle",
        "battleId": "B14"
      },
      "win_01": {
        "id": "win_01",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "断路杆滑落。抢修工扶着膝盖摘下面罩，没有再去捡武器。",
        "next": "win_02",
        "type": "stage",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "win_02": {
        "id": "win_02",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "往旁边站。别碰开关，也别碰那根线。",
        "next": "win_03",
        "portraits": {
          "right": "powerline_repairman"
        }
      },
      "win_03": {
        "id": "win_03",
        "speakerId": "plant_electrician",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "临时接线拆掉了。我再核对一次，就能把这条支线送回去。",
        "next": "win_04",
        "portraits": {
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "win_04": {
        "id": "win_04",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "电工依次完成操作，居民支线的状态灯转为正常。他通过值班终端确认了来电回报。",
        "next": "win_05",
        "type": "stage",
        "portraits": {
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "win_05": {
        "id": "win_05",
        "speakerId": "plant_electrician",
        "speakerSide": "right",
        "text": "这一片恢复了。入口我会锁好，今天这份委托可以结了。",
        "next": "win_06",
        "portraits": {
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "win_06": {
        "id": "win_06",
        "speakerId": "@player",
        "speakerSide": "left",
        "text": "好。剩下的厂区你别一个人进去，那里还有他们的人。",
        "next": "finish",
        "portraits": {
          "right": ""
        }
      },
      "lose": {
        "id": "lose",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "战败结果已记录。后续剧情待补。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。"
      },
      "surrender": {
        "id": "surrender",
        "speakerId": "",
        "speakerSide": "",
        "text": "投降结果已记录。后续剧情待补。此次事件尚未完成，未发放奖励。",
        "next": "@map"
